<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.disk.settles ~ a stalled settle word asked again, over its pending carriers alone

`lares ingest apply=true` leaves the carriers still waiting as the bag's record under the house's run dir (`settlePendingPath`) when no page settled within the stall window. `settle --bag <bag> --pending` asks the word again over those carriers alone, then clears the record (settled whole) or rewrites it (still waiting). It reads no face, so `--face` refuses as usage, and it asks no confirmation.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ resume

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`resume` params=`bag/lares pending/true ~ ask the stalled word again over its recorded carriers`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ bag · pending

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bag` params=`takes/bag-uri-or-slug needs/required ~ the bag whose pending settle record to resume`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pending` params=`kind/switch needs/required ~ name the resume; settle takes no other posture`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the word rides the island's settle gate, which checks the cap on the bag; the record under the run dir rewrites or clears`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.disk.settles bag/<bag> pending/true]] ~ settle resumes a stalled settle word from its record, and needs the bag and --pending`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ settled · waiting

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`settled` params=`exit/0 ~ every recorded carrier settled; the record cleared`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`waiting` params=`exit/0 ~ some carriers still wait; the record rewrote with those alone`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

